{"actor":"Galex Yen","comment":null,"created_at":"2026-03-03T21:09:59Z","event_type":"status_changed","id":33,"issue_id":"edgar-diff-ttj","new_value":"{\"status\":\"in_progress\"}","old_value":"{\"id\":\"edgar-diff-ttj\",\"title\":\"Prototype A1: htmlparser2 DomHandler source mapping\",\"description\":\"Implement the primary approach from architecture doc. Use htmlparser2 with DomHandler (withStartIndices/withEndIndices). Fetch a real 10-K from EDGAR, parse it, identify 5 section boundaries, validate html.slice(start,end) accuracy, test multi-byte characters. Measure parse time. Deliverable: libs/edgar-diff-lib/spikes/source-mapping/ on branch spike-a1-htmlparser2.\",\"status\":\"open\",\"priority\":1,\"issue_type\":\"task\",\"owner\":\"galexy@users.noreply.github.com\",\"created_at\":\"2026-03-04T05:09:33Z\",\"created_by\":\"Galex Yen\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-03-04T05:09:33Z\"}"}
